@ERP.api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7021
@ApiKey = MorphicErp_SecureKey_2026

### 1. Test Security Gate (Missing API Key - Expected: 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{ERP.api_HostAddress}}/api/companies
Accept: application/json

### 2. User Authentication / Login (Tenant A - Cirunay)
POST {{ERP.api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{ApiKey}}

{
  "companyName": "Tenant A",
  "username": "cirunay",
  "password": "09092121"
}

### 3. Get Products for Tenant 1 (Live Stock from Tenant DB)
GET {{ERP.api_HostAddress}}/api/tenant/1/products
Accept: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{ApiKey}}

### 4. Create Product in Tenant 1
POST {{ERP.api_HostAddress}}/api/tenant/1/products
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{ApiKey}}

{
  "productCode": "GPU002",
  "productName": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 12GB",
  "unitPrice": 599.99,
  "stockQuantity": 5,
  "categoryName": "Graphics Cards (GPU)",
  "description": "12GB GDDR6X Dual Fan GPU",
  "isActive": true
}

### 5. Update Product in Tenant 1 (Price & Stock)
PUT {{ERP.api_HostAddress}}/api/tenant/1/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{ApiKey}}

{
  "productCode": "GPU001",
  "productName": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 8GB (Updated)",
  "unitPrice": 319.99,
  "stockQuantity": 15,
  "categoryName": "Graphics Cards (GPU)",
  "description": "High-performance ray-tracing GPU",
  "isActive": true
}

### 6. Process POS Order (Checkout & Deduct Stock)
POST {{ERP.api_HostAddress}}/api/tenant/1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{ApiKey}}

{
  "companyId": 1,
  "customerName": "Walk-in Customer",
  "subtotal": 319.99,
  "discount": 0.00,
  "tax": 38.40,
  "totalAmount": 358.39,
  "paymentMethod": "Cash",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "productName": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 8GB",
      "unitPrice": 319.99,
      "quantity": 1,
      "totalPrice": 319.99
    }
  ]
}

### 7. Query Company Subscription Plan
GET {{ERP.api_HostAddress}}/api/companies/1/subscription
Accept: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{ApiKey}}
